  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"876\" height=\"285\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"789\" height=\"127\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Advanced Peripherals 是一个为 CC: Tweaked（ComputerCraft）添加许多有用扩展的模组。<br>该模组旨在添加旧版 Minecraft 中类似 PeripheralsPlusOne 或 Plethora 等模组中可用的功能。<br>通过 Advanced Peripherals，您可以仅使用聊天消息来控制您的基地，<br>通过我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.advanced-peripherals.de%252fintegrations%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组集成</a> 控制您梦想中的模组，<br>或者随心所欲地修改世界！&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">在使用 CC: Tweaked（ComputerCraft）和 Advanced Peripherals 进行创作时，您没有任何限制。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span><span>如果您想支持我，可以通过 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srendi\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 进行。但任何形式的支持都能激励我！</span></span> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"122\"><br>如果您需要帮助，请加入 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您有建议或发现了问题，请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Seniorendi/AdvancedPeripherals\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上告诉我们！<br><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Information.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"119\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增内容</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Advanced Peripherals 是一个拥有大量功能的模组。<br>查看我们的文档以获取完整列表。<br><br>所有内容的文档：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.intelligence-modding.de</a><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>计划中的功能</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">计划中的功能列表很长。您可以在此处查看部分（非全部）功能：<a href=\"https://github.com/Seniorendi/AdvancedPeripherals/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果您有建议，也可以在此处提出。<br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>视频</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">欢迎制作关于此模组的视频。<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>toastonrye 制作的教程<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vegXpliPFhA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><br>0.7r 更新日志</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tIpBTgSkWr0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>示例</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们提供了一系列带有简单脚本的功能示例。请查看文档以了解它们<br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">文档</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们为您编写了完整的说明书！您可以在此访问 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>！<br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmyftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://intelligence-modding.de/images/MyFTB_Full.png\" alt=\"MyFTB\" width=\"980\" height=\"392\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">您正在寻找新的且具有挑战性的冒险吗？<br>梦想着机器、发电厂、魔法甚至是蜜蜂？<br>MyFTB 是最大的德语模组化 Minecraft 网络。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一个世界还不够！因此，每位玩家在我们这里都拥有自己的世界。<br>独自游玩或与团队一起玩，获得最大的灵活性和安全性，享受极致的游戏乐趣。<br>拥有超过 20 个模组包，您一定能找到适合您的那一个！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>查看他们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmyftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a>、<a href=\"https://discord.gg/myftb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flauncher.myftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">启动器</a><br>在 MyFTB 启动器中，您始终拥有在我们服务器上玩所需的正确模组包版本。此外，服务器数据也会直接保存！<br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">用法：</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果您愿意，可以在任何模组包中使用此模组。</span></p>",
